# ── Local agent/tool scratch (RBR-786 triage) ───────────────────────
# Not compliance evidence, not source. Machine-local or regenerable.
.claude/
.envrc
.paperclip/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
graphify-out/
heartbeat-comments/

# Per-issue agent working plans. Scratch that goes stale the moment the
# issue closes; the durable record is the issue thread and the commits.
plans/

# Transient PDF-rendering temp files (RFQ packet generation) that land in
# the repo root and are never cleaned up by the tool that creates them.
toPdfViaTempFile*

# ── Nested working repos, NOT submodules ────────────────────────────
# These carry their own .git dir. `git add` on them would create a
# gitlink to a commit no other clone can resolve, which is worse than
# leaving them untracked. Promote to a real submodule deliberately if
# they ever need to be referenced from here.
Aira-Architecture/
Aira-ISO27001/
Aira-Program-Management/

# ── Binary office docs with no diffable history value ───────────────
PasswordManagement/
